        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>[ MURMUR ]</strong></i> is a first-person psychological horror game focused on <strong>anomaly detection</strong>.<br>Inside a seemingly ordinary house, reality quietly twists. Details shift, presences appear and vanish, and one wrong decision can be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must observe, listen, and keep your composure to identify the anomalies around you. But beware: some entities don’t just want to be seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997270/extras/4786411f7935be7aa7da15ee303ac3f6.avif?t=1759317795\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay built on attention and tension</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constant observation</strong>: the environment subtly changes. Your survival depends on noticing what’s out of place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied mechanics</strong>: each entity has its own rules and unique jumpscares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Round-based progression</strong>: the longer you last, the harder it gets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997270/extras/5249e95bb2c1c8b2213603860ed54c0b.avif?t=1759317795\" width=1560 height=862 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive, unsettling atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique entities designed to surprise and terrify.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability with randomly generated anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intense experience for fans of psychological horror and constant tension.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997270/extras/869816f2c5c046d5041e4fca5a9c3f67.avif?t=1759317795\" width=1560 height=854 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>[ MURMUR ]</strong> </i>is developed by <strong>Room 14 Studio</strong>, an independent french studio passionate about psychological horror and immersive experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I developed <strong><i>[ MURMUR ]</i></strong> solo in just five months. It’s a passion project above all, so I hope you’ll enjoy playing it despite its flaws. Thank you for your support!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>[ MURMUR ]</strong></i> is a first-person psychological horror game focused on <strong>anomaly detection</strong>.<br>Inside a seemingly ordinary house, reality quietly twists. Details shift, presences appear and vanish, and one wrong decision can be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must observe, listen, and keep your composure to identify the anomalies around you. But beware: some entities don’t just want to be seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997270/extras/4786411f7935be7aa7da15ee303ac3f6.avif?t=1759317795\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay built on attention and tension</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constant observation</strong>: the environment subtly changes. Your survival depends on noticing what’s out of place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied mechanics</strong>: each entity has its own rules and unique jumpscares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Round-based progression</strong>: the longer you last, the harder it gets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997270/extras/5249e95bb2c1c8b2213603860ed54c0b.avif?t=1759317795\" width=1560 height=862 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive, unsettling atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique entities designed to surprise and terrify.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability with randomly generated anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intense experience for fans of psychological horror and constant tension.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997270/extras/869816f2c5c046d5041e4fca5a9c3f67.avif?t=1759317795\" width=1560 height=854 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>[ MURMUR ]</strong> </i>is developed by <strong>Room 14 Studio</strong>, an independent french studio passionate about psychological horror and immersive experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I developed <strong><i>[ MURMUR ]</i></strong> solo in just five months. It’s a passion project above all, so I hope you’ll enjoy playing it despite its flaws. Thank you for your support!</p>",
